            <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#dbeafe;margin:0 0 18px;">The best choice depends on how and where you listen. Soundcore Space 2 is the strongest premium travel option, Edifier W800BT Pro offers impressive budget ANC features, BERIBES is an accessible everyday over-ear model, Picun B8 leads for battery life, OneOdio A71 serves creators, PocBuds T60 suits workouts, CXK X13 preserves outdoor awareness, and NUBWO HT02 is purpose-built for TV.</p>
